OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight heavy rain will
OL,6,Fquickly clear northern coasts, staying
OL,7,Fdry with occasional sunny spells
OL,8,Felsewhere. Showers developing widely
OL,9,Ffrom midday, often heavy with a risk
OL,10,Fof thunder in places. Temperatures
OL,11,Faround normal. Breezy inland, rather
OL,12,Fwindy along coasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers easing off with some
OL,15,Flate evening sunshine possible.
OL,16,FOccasional clear spells overnight with
OL,17,Fmostly light winds, although remaining
OL,18,Fbreezy for eastern coasts. Mild,
OL,19,Fperhaps even warm in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
