OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FDry to start with some early
OL,6,Fsunny spells for eastern parts. Rain,
OL,7,Fheavy and perhaps thundery at times,
OL,8,Fbecoming widespread from late morning,
OL,9,Fpersisting for the rest of the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,12,FUnsettled weather looks set to
OL,13,Fcontinue into the start of next week
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain or showers,
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy with the risk of
OL,16,Fthunder. Temperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
